  "limits": [
    "Only explicit decimal, percentage and scientific scalar formats are authored. Precision is 0-30, with grouping and four negative styles for decimal/percentage; scientific uses minus negatives without grouping.",
    "Automatic, currency, fraction, temporal, custom and locale-specific format creation remain unsupported.",
    "Display does not increase the precision of the finite double scalar. Tables have fixed dimensions and caller-selected fonts; receiving applications own fitting, localization and pagination.",
    "OfficeIMO DOCX and PPTX display uses invariant separators and reports approximation for locale and appearance. Native and destination layout/font equivalence is not qualified.",
    "Numbers XLSX cannot represent inherited native four-point cell padding and requires explicit partial acceptance; complete PDF workflows continue to reject that omission.",
